4-0","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"4kt_0ar_aqo_AAAA","source_quote":"子畿，累官太子右衛率、雋州刺史。","reading":"子畿累官太子右衛率、雋州刺史。殿本文字兩見「幾」，《梁書》元帝紀另作巂州刺史裴畿。","note":"子畿累官太子右衛率、雋州刺史。殿本文字兩見「幾」，《梁書》元帝紀另作巂州刺史裴畿。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete:p004","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":16,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete-ws1511902"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete:received_sentence4-16","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"4kt_0ar_aqo_AAAA","source_quote":"西魏攻陷江陵，畿力戰死之。","reading":"西魏陷江陵，畿力戰死。父之高卒、子畿陣亡各立事證。","note":"西魏陷江陵，畿力戰死。父之高卒、子畿陣亡各立事證。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete:p004","start_codepoint":16,"end_codepoint":29,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete-ws1511902"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-liang028-ji-zhigao","subject_person_id":"4kt_0ar_aqo_AAAA","object_person_id":"4kt_0ar_aqo_AAA","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"子畿","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete-ws1511902","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete:p003","quote":"侯景亂，之高率衆入援，南豫州刺史、鄱陽嗣王範命之高總督江右援軍諸軍事，頓于張公洲。柳仲禮至橫江，之高遣船舸二百餘艘迎致仲禮，與韋粲等俱會青塘立營，據建興苑。及城陷，之高還合肥，與鄱陽王範西上。稍至新蔡，衆將一萬，未有所屬。元帝遣蕭慧正召之，以爲侍中、護軍將軍。到江陵，承制除特進、金紫光祿大夫。卒，時年七十三。贈侍中、儀同三司，鼓吹一部。諡曰恭。","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete:p003:m0004"},{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete-ws1511902","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete:p004","quote":"子畿，累官太子右衛率、雋州刺史。西魏攻陷江陵，畿力戰死之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhigao-complete:p004:m0001"}],"context":{"kind":"adjacent_paragraphs","paragra